    <string name="primedgun_transfer_prompt_detail">Pick the memory card file (.raw or .gcp) from your old PrimedGun install. PrimedGun will back up the current card, copy the old one into place, then offer to import your old PrimedGun.ini settings. Per-game GameSettings, GameSettingsVR, and shader overrides are not transferred.</string>
